", 1.568, 1.636], ["deal", 1.636, 1.977], ["and", 2.364, 2.455], ["two", 2.466, 2.648], ["Papa", 2.659, 2.977], ["John's", 2.977, 3.284], ["pizzas", 3.284, 3.682], ["arrived", 3.682, 4.102], ["at", 4.102, 4.136], ["his", 4.148, 4.239], ["door", 4.239, 4.591]]}, {"text": "It's seen as the first time anyone bought real goods with bitcoin.", "start": 20.052, "end": 23.652, "spec": {"type": "receipt", "mood": "calm"}, "words": [["It's", 0.08, 0.193], ["seen", 0.193, 0.386], ["as", 0.386, 0.466], ["the", 0.466, 0.545], ["first", 0.545, 0.852], ["time", 0.852, 1.193], ["anyone", 1.341, 1.67], ["bought", 1.682, 2.011], ["real", 2.023, 2.352], ["goods", 2.352, 2.659], ["with", 2.659, 2.795], ["bitcoin", 2.795, 3.273]]}, {"text": "But here's the crazy part. Today, those ten thousand bitcoin are worth about eight hundred million dollars.", "start": 23.852, "end": 30.044, "spec": {"type": "chart", "mood": "tense", "cut": true}, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.148], ["here's", 0.148, 0.386], ["the", 0.398, 0.477], ["crazy", 0.477, 0.83], ["part", 0.83, 1.17], ["Today", 1.545, 1.875], ["those", 2.023, 2.193], ["ten", 2.193, 2.375], ["thousand", 2.375, 2.705], ["bitcoin", 2.705, 3.17], ["are", 3.261, 3.489], ["worth", 3.489, 4.034], ["about", 4.273, 4.545], ["eight", 4.682, 4.784], ["hundred", 4.784, 5.068], ["million", 5.068, 5.318], ["dollars", 5.33, 5.864]]}, {"text": "That's more than nineteen million times what he paid.", "start": 30.244, "end": 32.788, "spec": {"type": "money"}, "words": [["That's", 0.091, 0.193], ["more", 0.193, 0.318], ["than", 0.318, 0.42], ["nineteen", 0.42, 0.886], ["million", 0.886, 1.239], ["times", 1.25, 1.67], ["what", 1.67, 1.761], ["he", 1.761, 1.83], ["paid", 1.841, 2.193]]}, {"text": "And every year on May twenty-second, people celebrate it as Bitcoin Pizza Day.", "start": 32.988, "end": 37.5, "spec": {"type": "party"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.193], ["every", 0.205, 0.42], ["year", 0.42, 0.67], ["on", 0.682, 0.761], ["May", 0.761, 0.875], ["twent